=== Generic Traits Demo ===
--- 1. Type parameter as method parameter (Comparable<T>) ---
  IntComparer(10).CompareTo(5) = 5
--- 2. Same trait, different type arg (Comparable<string>) ---
  StringComparer.CompareTo("world") = 0
--- 3. Type parameter as field type (Container<T>) ---
  IntBox(42) via Container<int>.Data = 42
--- 4. Type parameter as return type (Provider<T>) ---
  NameProvider via Provider<string>.Provide() = hello
--- 5. Multiple type parameters (Converter<TIn, TOut>) ---
  IntToString via Converter<int,string>.Convert(7) = converted
--- 6. Non-generic trait inheritance ---
  trait ReadWriteStream : Readable, Writable { void Flush(); }
--- 7. Structural satisfaction of non-generic trait ---
  MemoryStream.Read() via Readable = data from memory
--- 8. With-block mapping for non-generic trait ---
  Logger.Write() via Writable called successfully
--- 9. Passing to trait-typed parameter ---
  PrintReadable: data from memory
=== Generic Traits Demo Complete ===
